                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"288\" height=\"128\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">\u2705 GLBP group 1 Configured\n\n\u2705 Round-Robin mode Activated\n\n\u2705 Preemption Enabled to ensure takeover\n\n\u2705 Successfull Ping from End Device</text></svg>",
