            {
                "drawing_id": "f7af3290-cbc0-486a-b299-5557ddf66413",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"288\" height=\"344\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">&gt;&gt; Normal Behaviour:\n\nSwitch2#show glbp\nFastEthernet0/1 - Group 1\n  State is Active\n  Virtual IP address is 192.168.1.3\n  Preemption enabled\n  Priority 110 (configured)\n  Weighting 100 (default 100), \n\tthresholds: lower 1, upper 100\n  Load balancing: round-robin\n\nSwitch3#show glbp\nFastEthernet0/1 - Group 1\n  State is Listen\n  Virtual IP address is 192.168.1.3\n  Preemption enabled\n  Priority 100 (default)\n  Weighting 100 (default 100), \n\tthresholds: lower 1, upper 100\n  Load balancing: round-robin</text></svg>",
                "x": -92,
                "y": -129,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "a0cd85b0-2cb7-4fd9-b8a5-e08dab4c10cf",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"292\" height=\"344\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">&gt;&gt; After shutting down Fa0/1 on Switch 2:\n\nSwitch2#show glbp\nFastEthernet0/1 - Group 1\n  State is Init (interface down)\n  Virtual IP address is 192.168.1.3\n  Preemption enabled\n  Priority 110 (configured)\n  Weighting 100 (default 100), \n\tthresholds: lower 1, upper 100\n  Load balancing: round-robin\n\nSwitch3#show glbp\nFastEthernet0/1 - Group 1\n  State is Active\n  Virtual IP address is 192.168.1.3\n  Preemption enabled\n  Priority 100 (default)\n  Weighting 100 (default 100), \n\tthresholds: lower 1, upper 100\n  Load balancing: round-robin</text></svg>",
                "x": 224,
